# ==============================================================================
# Output Snippet: Full Trajectory Dump (positions + velocities + forces)
# Apply when: MLFF active learning, error estimation, or any workflow that needs
#             velocities/forces in addition to coordinates
# ==============================================================================
# USAGE:
# - Larger files than a plain xyz dump; choose N (dump stride) accordingly.
# - dump_modify sort id keeps atom order stable across frames (needed for MSD etc.).
# - Common extras: `dump_modify <id> append yes` (continue a run), `format line`
#   or `format native` for text formats, `units yes` to tag units in the file.

dump            1 all custom 100 traj_full.lammpstrj id type x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz
dump_modify     1 sort id
